<section class="salah-detail sec" id="salah-detail" data-od-id="salah-detail">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head center reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow center">Inside each prayer window</span>
      <h2>A lock screen with <span class="it">adab.</span></h2>
      <p>The moment is designed to feel like a gentle threshold, not a punishment. Barakah gives you what helps you pray and removes what pulls you away.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="salah-grid">
      <article class="salah-card reveal">
        <div class="salah-icon" aria-hidden="true">أ</div>
