        <p>A single calm adhan cue opens the window, then Barakah settles into silence. No notification pile-up, no productivity scolding.</p>
        <div class="salah-meter"><span style="width:72%"></span></div>
      </article>
      <article class="salah-card primary reveal d1">
        <div class="salah-icon" aria-hidden="true">ق</div>
