        <div class="qibla-face" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="needle"></span>
          <span class="kaaba">الكعبة</span>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="salah-card reveal d2">
        <div class="salah-icon" aria-hidden="true">ذ</div>
        <h3>Dhikr after salah</h3>
        <p>After the lock lifts, Barakah offers a quiet tasbih counter. Tap, breathe, leave when you're done. No points to chase.</p>
        <button class="mini-tasbih" type="button" id="miniTasbih"><span id="miniTasbihCount">33</span><small>tap</small></button>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
